## 🎯 Alur Pengguna yang Ideal

### **Skenario A: HRD cepat scan (90% kasus)**
```
→ Lihat TechStackSection (default)
→ 5 detik scan: "Oh, React 3y, Node.js 3y, PostgreSQL 2y..."
→ Klik "Download CV (PDF)"
→ Selesai
```

### **Skenario B: Tech Recruiter deep dive (10% kasus)**
```
→ Lihat default, penasaran dengan detail
→ Klik "View Detailed Stack"
→ Modal muncul dengan filter & search
→ Pilih kategori, filter Core/Solid/Learning
→ Baca metrics engineering + project mapping
→ Tutup modal, klik Download CV
```

### **Skenario C: Engineering Manager**
```
→ Buka modal langsung
→ Lihat metrics (Lighthouse 99, API <120ms, SELECT FOR UPDATE)
→ Tergiur, langsung kontak
```

